# Version branches

Follow the repository's `AGENTS.md` and `VERSION_CONTROL.md`.
Before starting a new version, create its own `version/v<major>.<minor>.<patch>` branch from the appropriate verified baseline.
Use the requested version number, or the next unused patch version after inspecting local and remote branches.
Keep previous version branches and publish with upstream tracking; do not force-push or develop a new version directly on `main`.
